[error] InvalidManifestScope  module.eco:5:7

  'hook' cannot be written inside a '{ ... }' scope - scopes do not nest, so a target or a hook is declared at file scope.

  4 | #[target: exe { name: "app", entry: "src/lib.eco" }] {
  5 |     #[hook: before_build { run: "gen" }]
    :       ^^^^
  6 | }

